# agentd's profiles: what an agent session may do (paper, §3).
#
#   name      caps  scope       max-procs
#
# Caps as ls -l shows them: r read, w write (under the scope only),
# s spawn (fork and exec), k kill, and '-' for each one missing. A
# profile without s couldn't run a command at all: sh forks to run one.
readonly    r-s-  /home/work  16
work-rw     rwsk  /home/work  32
